<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-fareast-font-family:Calibri'>MUHAMMET EM&#304;N
AKBA&#350;O&#286;LU (Çank&#305;r&#305;) – Aç&#305;klama, bilgilendirme…<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span style='font-size:9.0pt;
